r Marc Marquez announces MotoGP retirement, days after clinching record 8th world title, DW reports.","cites":["news:dw:3f20c4c08f5b"]},{"t":"2026-11-27T00:00:08Z","text":"However, on 27 November 2026, Márquez released a shock announcement during FP1 in Valencia that he will be retiring at the end of the 2026 season.","cites":["wiki:rev:1388413746:489"]},{"t":"2026-11-27T00:00:16Z","text":"Marc Márquez Alentà (born 17 February 1993) is a Spanish Grand Prix motorcycle road racer who races for the Ducati Lenovo Team in MotoGP.","cites":["wiki:rev:1388413746:0"]},{"t":"2026-11-27T00:00:24Z","text":"Marc Márquez was born on 17 February 1993 in Cervera.","cites":["wd:Q40615:P569","wd:Q40615:P19"]},{"t":"2026-11-27T00:00:32Z","text":"Played for 4 clubs from 2008 to 2024: from Honda Racing to Ducati MotoGP Team.","cites":["wd:Q40615:P54:Q1248485","wd:Q40615:P54:Q1573456","wd:Q40615:P54:Q975614","wd:Q40615:P54:Q110714718"]},{"t":"2026-11-27T00:00:42Z","text":"7 awards on record, among them Marca Leyenda (2017) and Catalan Sportsman/Sportswoman of the Year (2019).","cites":["wd:Q40615:P166:Q3820035","wd:Q40615:P166:Q28710767"]},{"t":"2026-11-27T00:00:52Z","text":"28 November: Spain faces political shift as far right gains ground, Al Jazeera reported.","cites":["news:aljazeera:53ab840c5988"]},{"t":"2026-11-27T00:00:59Z","text":"28 November: Spain's Sanchez makes final appeal to voters before election, DW reported.","cites":["news:dw:097c77a9a9e9"]},{"t":"2026-11-27T00:01:06Z","text":"Fighting Spain’s far-right through art, Al Jazeera reports.","cites":["news:aljazeera:4d03f70b1a5f"]},{"t":"2026-11-27T00:01:13Z","text":"Spanish PM and rivals rally supporters in final pitch for votes, BBC News reports.","cites":["news:bbc:21d8bca4dce9"]},{"t":"2026-11-27T00:01:29Z","text":"DW headlined it: “Spanish rider Marc Marquez announces MotoGP retirement, days after clinching record 8th world title”","cites":["news:dw:3f20c4c08f5b"]},{"t":"2026-11-27T00:01:40Z","text":"Sources: DW, Al Ja